3550 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Escape Protocol is a single\055player level built in Unreal Engine 5\0567\054 designed around player choice\054 spatial exploration\054 and escalating tension\056 You play as a military officer trapped inside a prison under siege by a mafia gang attempting to free their boss\056 With helicopter extraction as your only way out\054 you must navigate through chaos managing health\054 gear\054 and enemies while finding your path to the helipad\056\050\050The level is built to support two distinct play styles\056 Players who prefer direct confrontation can fight through enemy encounters using the arsenal available throughout the level\056 Those who favour patience can slip through undetected using stealth and the environment to their advantage\056 Every major section offers both options the choice always belongs to the player\056\050\050The locomotion system used in this project is AGLS by LongmireLocomotion \050Jakub Wo\133\051\056 All level design\054 spatial layout\054 encounter design\054 pacing\054 and environmental storytelling is original work\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 3551 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

