3560 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Last of Us Part I \046 II shaped the core combat philosophy of Escape Protocol stealth and aggression as equally valid approaches\054 with the environment providing opportunities for both\056 Player choice in every encounter was a direct design goal drawn from this\056\n\n\n\n\n\050\050\050\050)
