3564 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tomb Raider influenced the exploration and traversal design\056 The sense of navigating a decaying\054 structurally compromised space  finding hidden passages\054 using the environment to progress  runs throughout the level\054 particularly in the cell block and collapsed sections\056)
