3594 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Technique Highlight 4\072 Environmental Storytelling Through Readable Objects\050\050My Method\072 Narrative is delivered entirely through the environment \024 notes\054 fax documents\054 monologues\054 and spatial context \024 never through cutscenes or forced exposition\056\050\050How I Executed It\072 Two key notes carry the story\056 The first\054 found in Beat 2\054 establishes the threat\072 mafia gunmen sweeping the prison\054 stay quiet\054 stay alive\056 The second\054 a formal fax document found in the Beat 5 control room\054 reveals the extraction point for the first time \024 Tower 1 Helipad\054 last scheduled extraction\054 proceed without delay\056 Together they give the player all the narrative information they need at exactly the right moments\056\050\050Level Example\072 The fax document is the narrative turning point of the entire level\056 Up to that moment the player was surviving on instinct\056 After reading it they have a clear objective and a sense of urgency\056\050\050)
     /K [ 28 ]
     /P 3595 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
