  << /ActualText (Technique Highlight 3\072 Escalating Combat Introduction\050\050My Method\072 Combat is introduced gradually across beats \024 never overwhelming the player before they are ready\054 always giving them the tools before the threat\056\050\050How I Executed It\072 Beat 1 has zero combat\056 Beat 2 introduces a harmless enemy with a monologue prompt before the first real encounter\056 Weapon storage and practice dummies appear before the first gunfight\056 By Beat 6 the player is equipped and experienced enough for the level\047s most demanding encounters\056\050\050Level Example\072 The weapon storage room in Beat 2 \024 ammo\054 weapons\054 and practice dummies all placed before any real threat \024 ensures the player never feels thrown into combat unprepared\056)
