  << /ActualText (Technique Highlight 5\072 Dual Path Climax\050\050My Method\072 The final beat offers two genuinely different routes to the same extraction point \024 one favouring stealth\054 one favouring combat \024 both requiring skill and both delivering the same conclusion\056\050\050How I Executed It\072 The stealth path uses cover objects on the bridge\054 requires patience and crouch movement\054 and rewards players who maintained a quiet approach throughout\056 The combat path rewards players who built their arsenal across all previous beats\056 Neither path is easier \024 they are balanced differently for different playstyles\056\050\050Level Example\072 The annotated top\055down map of Beat 6 shows both routes clearly \024 red for stealth\054 orange for combat \024 demonstrating the dual path design was intentional and planned\056)
