  << /ActualText (Level Map \024 Top Down Overview\n\nEscape Protocol is built across four towers arranged around a central courtyard\056 Tower 1 \050top right\051 is where the player begins\056 The level flows through Tower 2 \050top left\051\054 across the courtyard\054 into Tower 3 \050bottom left\051\054 and finally up to Tower 1 \050top right\051 where the helicopter awaits\056 The red dotted lines show the two available ground\055level routes through the courtyard in Beat 6 \024 stealth through cover or direct combat\056 The green lines mark the zipline connecting Tower 4 to Tower 1\054 the final traversal before extraction\056)
     /K [ 40 ]
     /P 3619 0 R
