3702 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Beat 1 \024 Movement Onboarding\050\050Early playtests showed players frequently falling into gaps after standard walk\055jumps\056 I redesigned the platform to teach movement progressively \024 introducing a short jump before a long jump\054 adding a runway for momentum\054 and placing an on\055screen prompt before the larger gap\056\050\050Players still fell into the pit\056 Rather than removing the challenge I turned it into a teaching moment \024 adding ledge grab surfaces inside the pit so players discovered the mechanic naturally\056 From that point forward no further ledge indicators were needed\056\050\050)
     /K [ 82 ]
     /P 3703 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

