3708 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Beat 2 \024 Narrative Timing \053 Enemy Layout\050\050The narrative letter originally appeared after the first enemy encounter\054 disrupting the story flow\056 After testing I moved it before the encounter so players understood the situation before facing danger\056\050\050The first enemy was originally patrolling but the space was too tight for new players\056 I replaced him with a stationary guard and used narrative text to introduce stealth takedowns\056 Two patrolling gunmen on the same floor overwhelmed players \024 I introduced vertical separation\054 placing them on an upper floor with an ammunition room below\056 A rifle pickup made the encounter too easy so I removed it\054 limiting the player to a pistol\056 The hidden silenced pistol was being missed due to ledge placement \024 I redesigned the area to force exploration so players discovered it naturally\056)
     /K [ 85 ]
     /P 3709 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

