3712 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Beat 3 \024 Rifle Placement \053 Visual Cues\050\050The rifle was originally placed immediately after Beat 2\054 breaking narrative urgency\056 I moved it later \024 after all traversal in Tower 2 was complete \024 and hid it in a chest near the bridge to Tower 3\056 Playtesters missed it due to darkness\054 so I added a red light cue to draw attention while still rewarding exploration\056\050\050This placement also strengthened narrative logic \024 the player receives a long\055range weapon right before entering open ground where it becomes essential\056\050\050A key piece of playtest feedback shaped this beat directly\072 one tester could not find the silenced pistol because there was no ledge guiding them to that floor\056 The reward was being completely missed\056 I added the ledge\054 redesigned the approach\054 and the item became discoverable without being handed to the player\056)
     /K [ 87 ]
     /P 3713 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
