  << /ActualText (Beat 4 \024 Arena Reveal \053 Sequence Control\050\050Players discovered they could jump directly from the broken bridge into the final combat arena\054 skipping an entire beat and entering unprepared\056 I added blocking volumes to prevent this\056 To preserve the intended preview moment I added a triggered sequence showing the arena layout\054 enemy positions and scale before the player entered\056\050\050The sniper rifle on this floor was initially too hidden\056 I added a subtle red light cue \024 consistent with the lighting language established in Beat 1 \024 encouraging players to use their torch to find it\056)
