3722 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Beat 5 \024 Control Room \053 Traversal\050\050The ledge climbing section was too similar to Beat 2 and felt repetitive\056 I added a central column blocking the vent from view\054 forcing players to explore the control room before finding the route\056 Players were confused about where to go after entering the arena\054 so I added CCTV monitors showing clear pathways ahead\056\050\050The narrative letter format was repeated from Beat 2\054 so I replaced it with a fax document \024 different format\054 stronger urgency\054 clearer objective\056 Players attempted to backtrack through the vent causing fall damage\054 so I added a monologue preventing backtracking and reduced the vent size to make it one\055directional\056\050\050)
     /K [ 92 ]
     /P 3723 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
