3728 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Final Beat \024 Enemy Tuning \053 Spatial Clarity\050\050Two critical pieces of playtest feedback shaped the final beat\056\050\050First\054 the enemies were too difficult \024 players had to retry multiple times due to excessive enemy damage and health\056 I discovered enemies were using the same weapon stats as the player\054 making them disproportionately powerful\056 I reassigned their weapons to separate data slots and used the AGLS data table to reduce enemy damage and adjust health values\056 The final encounter became fair\054 challenging and satisfying\056\050\050Second\054 players outside could not identify which tower had the helipad\056 The fax document stated Tower 1 but all towers looked identical from ground level \024 players were moving aimlessly\056 I added large exterior tower labels \024 Tower 1\054 Tower 2\054 Tower 3\054 Tower 4 \024 visible from ground level and across the open yard\056 Immediately players oriented themselves correctly and the final push felt purposeful\056)
     /K [ 95 ]
     /P 3729 0 R
     /Pg 3538 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

